  const markup = "<main>\n    <header>\n      <h1>Four ways to shake<\/h1>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Play or tap a box to run one implementation once from zero. Drag its headed position-plot playhead to stop and inspect any exact model time; the velocity playhead and both plot markers stay synchronized. Every Slow animations control changes the same global 4× playback setting.<\/p>\n    <\/header>\n    <div class=\"transport\"><span>Selected<\/span><strong id=\"active-method\">None<\/strong><input id=\"time-slider\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.001\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Selected animation time\" disabled><strong id=\"time-value\">0.000s<\/strong><button id=\"restart\" type=\"button\">Reset all<\/button><\/div>\n    <p class=\"target-key\"><span><b>0.25s<\/b> left −60<\/span><span><b>0.75s<\/b> right +60<\/span><span><b>1.00s<\/b> center 0<\/span><span>241 calculated positions at exact timeline times<\/span><\/p>\n    <section class=\"examples\" aria-label=\"Shake implementations\">\n      <article class=\"example\" data-method=\"customAnimatable\" style=\"--curve:seagreen\">\n  <div class=\"example-head\"><div class=\"example-title\"><h2>Custom Animatable<\/h2><p class=\"example-summary\">One linearly animated progress value drives a sine function.<\/p><\/div><div class=\"example-actions\"><label class=\"slow-toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-slow-animations aria-label=\"Slow animations from Custom Animatable\">Slow animations<\/label><button class=\"reset-button\" type=\"button\" data-reset-method=\"customAnimatable\" aria-label=\"Reset Custom Animatable\">Reset<\/button><button class=\"run-button\" type=\"button\" data-run-method=\"customAnimatable\">Play<\/button><\/div><\/div>\n  <div class=\"example-content\">\n    <div class=\"example-state\">\n      <div class=\"track\"><button class=\"box\" type=\"button\" data-tap-method=\"customAnimatable\" aria-label=\"Tap box to play Custom Animatable\"><\/button><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"example-plots\">\n      <section class=\"example-plot\"><div class=\"example-plot-head\"><h3>x position · pt<\/h3><div class=\"plot-tools\"><output class=\"plot-time\" data-scrub-time=\"customAnimatable\" aria-label=\"Custom Animatable timeline time\">0.000s<\/output><\/div><\/div><div class=\"plot-surface\"><svg data-position-chart=\"customAnimatable\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Custom Animatable x position over time\"><\/svg><input class=\"playhead-control\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.001\" value=\"0\" data-scrub-method=\"customAnimatable\" aria-label=\"Scrub Custom Animatable timeline\"><\/div><\/section>\n      <section class=\"example-plot\"><div class=\"example-plot-head\"><h3>velocity · pt\/s<\/h3><\/div><div class=\"plot-surface\"><svg data-velocity-chart=\"customAnimatable\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Custom Animatable velocity over time\"><\/svg><\/div><\/section>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/article><article class=\"example\" data-method=\"phaseAnimator\" style=\"--curve:darkorange\">\n  <div class=\"example-head\"><div class=\"example-title\"><h2>Phase animator<\/h2><p class=\"example-summary\">Three phase transactions stop at the left and right targets.<\/p><\/div><div class=\"example-actions\"><label class=\"slow-toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-slow-animations aria-label=\"Slow animations from Phase animator\">Slow animations<\/label><button class=\"reset-button\" type=\"button\" data-reset-method=\"phaseAnimator\" aria-label=\"Reset Phase animator\">Reset<\/button><button class=\"run-button\" type=\"button\" data-run-method=\"phaseAnimator\">Play<\/button><\/div><\/div>\n  <div class=\"example-content\">\n    <div class=\"example-state\">\n      <div class=\"track\"><button class=\"box\" type=\"button\" data-tap-method=\"phaseAnimator\" aria-label=\"Tap box to play Phase animator\"><\/button><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"example-plots\">\n      <section class=\"example-plot\" data-authored-series=\"phaseAnimator\"><div class=\"example-plot-head\"><h3>x position · pt<\/h3><div class=\"plot-tools\"><span class=\"authored-key\"><i class=\"authored-dot\"><\/i>phase values<\/span><output class=\"plot-time\" data-scrub-time=\"phaseAnimator\" aria-label=\"Phase animator timeline time\">0.000s<\/output><\/div><\/div><div class=\"plot-surface\"><svg data-position-chart=\"phaseAnimator\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Phase animator x position over time\"><\/svg><input class=\"playhead-control\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.001\" value=\"0\" data-scrub-method=\"phaseAnimator\" aria-label=\"Scrub Phase animator timeline\"><\/div><\/section>\n      <section class=\"example-plot\"><div class=\"example-plot-head\"><h3>velocity · pt\/s<\/h3><\/div><div class=\"plot-surface\"><svg data-velocity-chart=\"phaseAnimator\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Phase animator velocity over time\"><\/svg><\/div><\/section>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/article><article class=\"example\" data-method=\"keyframeAnimator\" style=\"--curve:royalblue\">\n  <div class=\"example-head\"><div class=\"example-title\"><h2>Keyframe animator<\/h2><p class=\"example-summary\">Implicit cubic velocities join all three target segments.<\/p><\/div><div class=\"example-actions\"><label class=\"slow-toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-slow-animations aria-label=\"Slow animations from Keyframe animator\">Slow animations<\/label><button class=\"reset-button\" type=\"button\" data-reset-method=\"keyframeAnimator\" aria-label=\"Reset Keyframe animator\">Reset<\/button><button class=\"run-button\" type=\"button\" data-run-method=\"keyframeAnimator\">Play<\/button><\/div><\/div>\n  <div class=\"example-content\">\n    <div class=\"example-state\">\n      <div class=\"track\"><button class=\"box\" type=\"button\" data-tap-method=\"keyframeAnimator\" aria-label=\"Tap box to play Keyframe animator\"><\/button><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"example-plots\">\n      <section class=\"example-plot\" data-authored-series=\"keyframeAnimator\"><div class=\"example-plot-head\"><h3>x position · pt<\/h3><div class=\"plot-tools\"><span class=\"authored-key\"><i class=\"authored-dot\"><\/i>keyframe values<\/span><output class=\"plot-time\" data-scrub-time=\"keyframeAnimator\" aria-label=\"Keyframe animator timeline time\">0.000s<\/output><\/div><\/div><div class=\"plot-surface\"><svg data-position-chart=\"keyframeAnimator\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Keyframe animator x position over time\"><\/svg><input class=\"playhead-control\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.001\" value=\"0\" data-scrub-method=\"keyframeAnimator\" aria-label=\"Scrub Keyframe animator timeline\"><\/div><\/section>\n      <section class=\"example-plot\"><div class=\"example-plot-head\"><h3>velocity · pt\/s<\/h3><\/div><div class=\"plot-surface\"><svg data-velocity-chart=\"keyframeAnimator\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Keyframe animator velocity over time\"><\/svg><\/div><\/section>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/article><article class=\"example\" data-method=\"timelineView\" style=\"--curve:crimson\">\n  <div class=\"example-head\"><div class=\"example-title\"><h2>TimelineView calculation<\/h2><p class=\"example-summary\">The same sine path is calculated directly from elapsed time.<\/p><\/div><div class=\"example-actions\"><label class=\"slow-toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-slow-animations aria-label=\"Slow animations from TimelineView calculation\">Slow animations<\/label><button class=\"reset-button\" type=\"button\" data-reset-method=\"timelineView\" aria-label=\"Reset TimelineView calculation\">Reset<\/button><button class=\"run-button\" type=\"button\" data-run-method=\"timelineView\">Play<\/button><\/div><\/div>\n  <div class=\"example-content\">\n    <div class=\"example-state\">\n      <div class=\"track\"><button class=\"box\" type=\"button\" data-tap-method=\"timelineView\" aria-label=\"Tap box to play TimelineView calculation\"><\/button><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"example-plots\">\n      <section class=\"example-plot\"><div class=\"example-plot-head\"><h3>x position · pt<\/h3><div class=\"plot-tools\"><output class=\"plot-time\" data-scrub-time=\"timelineView\" aria-label=\"TimelineView calculation timeline time\">0.000s<\/output><\/div><\/div><div class=\"plot-surface\"><svg data-position-chart=\"timelineView\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"TimelineView calculation x position over time\"><\/svg><input class=\"playhead-control\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.001\" value=\"0\" data-scrub-method=\"timelineView\" aria-label=\"Scrub TimelineView calculation timeline\"><\/div><\/section>\n      <section class=\"example-plot\"><div class=\"example-plot-head\"><h3>velocity · pt\/s<\/h3><\/div><div class=\"plot-surface\"><svg data-velocity-chart=\"timelineView\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"TimelineView calculation velocity over time\"><\/svg><\/div><\/section>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/article>\n    <\/section>\n    <section class=\"charts\">\n      <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2>Combined position reference<\/h2><p>The separate plots above are easier to inspect; this overlay remains useful for seeing where the methods diverge.<\/p><svg id=\"position-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"All x positions over time\"><\/svg><div class=\"legend\" id=\"position-legend\"><\/div><\/div>\n      <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2>Combined velocity reference · dx\/dt<\/h2><p>A continuous line through each 0.25s and 0.75s landmark indicates a continuous first derivative.<\/p><svg id=\"velocity-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"All x velocities over time\"><\/svg><div class=\"legend\" id=\"velocity-legend\"><\/div><\/div>\n    <\/section>\n    <aside class=\"finding\"><strong>What the comparison reveals.<\/strong> Custom Animatable and TimelineView coincide because they use the same sine calculation, but they schedule it differently. PhaseAnimator reaches each target with zero velocity. SwiftUI's implicit cubic tangent is Catmull–Rom-like: position and velocity are continuous at each keyframe, but acceleration may jump. Because the ±60 keyframes have a nonzero 80 pt\/s tangent, they are points the curve passes through rather than extrema, so the cubic path overshoots them.<\/aside>\n    <footer>The plotted positions are calculated by the four deterministic timeline evaluators at 241 exact timestamps. The captured view graph and display-list runs are used only as an independent agreement check, reported on each card. The browser replays the calculated positions.<\/footer>\n  <\/main>";
